ot;}]\" class=\"dsm-text-notation-middle\">challenge</span><svg class=\"rough-annotation\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; overflow: visible; pointer-events: none; width: 100px; height: 100px;\"></svg><span class=\"dsm-text-notation-after\"> of your strategic mind!</span></h1>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>Step into the high-stakes world of Baltics, a tactical tabletop wargame that immerses players in the tension and complexity of modern military engagements.</p>\n<p>Set in the geopolitically charged Baltic region, this game offers a rich blend of strategy, realism, and innovation.</p>\n<p>Assume command of NATO or Russian forces and maneuver battalion-sized units across a contested map where every decision can shift the balance of power.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_row et_pb_row_1 et_animated et-pb-before-scroll-animation\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_2_5 et_pb_column_2  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module dsm_before_after_image dsm_before_after_image_1\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module_inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dsm-before-after-image-slider-wrapper dsm-before-after-image-slider-horizontal\"><div class=\"dsm_before_after_image_wrapper dsm-before-after-image-slider-container\" data-params=\"[{&quot;offset&quot;:&quot;0.5&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;horizontal&quot;,&quot;overlay&quot;:false,&quot;hover&quot;:false,&quot;handle&quot;:true,&quot;click&quot;:false}]\" style=\"height: 315.484px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://goosegamestudio.com/wp-content/uploads